                        "source_xml_line":  12,
                        "string_id":  "PMA_escape_3",
                        "occurrence":  1,
                        "EN":  "That was a mistake, Marked One. However, you\u0027ve passed the trial. As for Wolf and his lads - it\u0027s up to you how to deal them now. I\u0027m waiting for you to establish another task.",
                        "JA_current":  "That was a mistake, Marked One. However, you\u0027ve passed the trial. As for Wolf and his lads - it\u0027s up to you how to deal them now. I\u0027m waiting for you to establish another task.",
                        "JA_new":  "あれは失敗だったな、マークドワン。だが試練は越えた。ウルフと連中をどうするかは、お前次第だ。次の仕事を頼みたくなったら、また来い。待ってるぞ。",
                        "review_notes":  null,
                        "english_reference_status":  "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
